<body>
<h1>P6 速率應用進階_多段行程相對速度 — Answer Key (中英雙語)</h1>
<div class="en-title">Speed: Multi-stage & Relative</div>
<div class="stats">17 questions | P6 Term 2 | LF Academy 霖楓學苑 | Bilingual AK+EN</div>
<table>
<tr><th colspan="2">Warm-up / 熱身</th></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">1</td><td class="qa">60×2.5=150km</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">2</td><td class="qa">240÷80=3小時</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">3</td><td class="qa">速度和=120km/h，速度差=20km/h</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">4</td><td class="qa">150+350=500m</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">5</td><td class="qa">80+70=150km/h</td></tr>
<tr><th colspan="2">Level A / A層</th></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A1</td><td class="qa">240÷(70+50)=240÷120=2小時</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A2</td><td class="qa">70×2=140km</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A3</td><td class="qa">乙領先=60×1.5=90km，90÷(90-60)=90÷30=3小時</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A4</td><td class="qa">54km/h=15m/s，(120+180)÷15=300÷15=20秒</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A5</td><td class="qa">相距=500-(100+80)×1=500-180=320km</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">A6</td><td class="qa">72÷3.6=20m/s</td></tr>
<tr><th colspan="2">Level B / B層</th></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">B1</td><td class="qa">乙先走65×0.5=32.5km。剩餘=450-32.5=417.5km。時間=417.5÷(85+65)=417.5÷150≈2.78h≈2h47min</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">B2</td><td class="qa">90km/h=25m/s。(250+750)÷25=1000÷25=40秒</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">B3</td><td class="qa">小強領先=9×(20/60)=3km。3÷(15-9)=3÷6=0.5小時=30分鐘</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">B4</td><td class="qa">相遇時間=距離÷(60+40)。相遇後甲剩餘距離=40×相遇時間。甲續行時間=40T÷60=2T/3</td></tr>
<tr><th colspan="2">SSPA Killer / 殺手題</th></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">K1</td><td class="qa">乙先走35km。485÷160≈3.03h</td></tr>
<tr><td class="qn">K2</td><td class="qa">108km/h=30m/s。總距離=30×25=750m。橋長=750-180=570m</td></tr>

</table>
